# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# Jaecoo 5 five-door compact SUV, 2025 onwards.
#
# The Jaecoo 5 petrol 1.6T: the compact SUV with the vertical-slat waterfall
# grille, the split headlamps and the full-width tail bar. UK orders opened
# 23 July 2025 and sales began in October 2025. The E5 electric variant has a
# different nose and is not represented.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaecoo_5
#
# Dimensions 4.380 x 1.860 x 1.650 m, wheelbase 2.620 m (maker figures via
# Wikipedia; no UK brochure was parsed).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side profile exists. Image 1 is a near-side
# press composite about 5-8 degrees forward with an overlay line; the roof
# line, tail and wheel positions are usable, but it is the weakest image in
# the pack. The limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (a), the JAECOO UK palette as consulted 2026-11-20: Granite
# White, Basalt Black, Graphite Grey and Copper Green. Weights 12, 10, 10, 8,
# total 40, provisional.
#
# Speed 180 km/h. Comfort 85/458, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 85. Class 1.
# Dates are road presence: 2025 intro, retire dates commented out (still in production in 2026).
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/jaecoo-5.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/jaecoo-5.dae. References:
# citycars/references/jaecoo-5/ (gitignored; manufacturer press images held
# as internal reference only).
#
# Accepted deviations: no true side elevation exists, so the flank and shoulder
# are estimated from an oblique press composite. The petrol 1.6T nose only. The
# grille badge, the lamp internals and the handles are simplified.


obj=citycar
name=Jaecoo5(GraniteWhite)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=2025
intro_month=10
#retire_year=2048
#retire_month=6
speed=180
class=1
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=85
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=458

Image[E]=./images/jaecoo-5-granitewhite_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/jaecoo-5-granitewhite_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/jaecoo-5-granitewhite_S.0.0,0,0
